        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adrian Boult, Colin Sauer, Sergei Diaghilev, John Barbirolli\n- Organizations: Royal Opera House, Hallé Orchestra, BBC Symphony Orchestra\n- Places: Leipzig, Germany, London, Covent Garden\n- Topics: musical studies, conducting, ballet, opera\n\nFacts:\n- Adrian Boult was brought up in a prosperous mercantile family.\n- Adrian Boult pursued musical studies in England and in Leipzig, Germany.\n- Adrian Boult did early conducting work in London for the Royal Opera House and for Sergei Diaghilev's ballet company.\n- The Royal Opera House is an opera house and major performing arts venue in Covent Garden, central London.\n- Colin Sauer played with the Hallé Orchestra under John Barbirolli.\n- Colin Sauer played with the BBC Symphony Orchestra under Adrian Boult.",
